    "title_en": "New measurement of BR$(K^+\\rightarrowπ^+ν\\barν)$ at the NA62 experiment",
    "abstract_en": "The decay $K^+\\rightarrowπ^+ν\\barν$ with a very precisely predicted branching ratio of less than $10^{-10}$ is one of the best candidates to reveal indirect effects of new physics at the highest mass scales. The NA62 experiment at the CERN SPS is designed to measure the branching ratio of the $K^+\\rightarrowπ^+ν\\barν$ decay. A new measurement of its branching ratio based on the 20230-2024 dataset is presented. This doubles the total dataset, leading to a 5$σ$ expected sensitivity for the Standard Model process.",
